    <section>
      <header>Overview</header>
      <text>
        <p>
          All keyboard shortcuts can be changed for the current user.
          It is also possible to assign shortcuts to your favorite view.
        </p>

        <p>
          <A HREF="img/Keyboard Mapping.png" target="$IMAGETARGET">
            <img src="img/Keyboard Mapping.png" width="$IMAGEWIDTH" border="0" />
          </A>
        </p>

        <p>
          Select a command to add or edit its shortcut. Clicking Restore restores the default shortcut for the command.
        </p>
      </text>
    </section>
